	(text "Pins to Avoid\n\nGPIO2: This pin is a strapping pin and should be kept high during normal operation. \"Do not add high-value capacitors at GPIO0, or the chip may enter download mode.\"\nGPIO15: This pin is also a strapping pin and should be kept high during normal operation. \"GPIO15: This is another strapping pin and should be kept high during normal operation.\"\nGPIO34 to GPIO39: These are input-only pins and cannot be used as outputs. \"GPIO34 to GPIO39: These are input-only pins and cannot be used as outputs.\"\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 128.524 363.474 0)
